            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Điện Biên Grill Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Kotoejka\n25 contributions\n0\nFriendly staff, delicious food, air conditioning\nAug 2023 • Friends\nNice place with delicious, fresh seafood. There are both Vietnamese and European cuisine. We ordered steamed shrimp with lemongrass, octopus, grilled squid with chili, fish, oysters baked with cheese - everything was very tasty, I was especially pleased with the introduction to oysters, suitable for those who are afraid to try raw ones. We returned to the establishment again for some hot pot (we wanted to cook some soup for ourselves), it wasn’t in the restaurant that day, but the staff was so attentive and hospitable to get it for us from a nearby service cafe👍🏻 P.S. - there is a condo 😊 Prices are average for Nha Trang: kg of shrimp 480 thousand, dishes on average 140-220 thousand dong.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten August 4, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
