            "review_text": "Ken W\n82 contributions\n0\nRoom for improvements, but food was very good.\nMay 2023 • Friends\nI tried this place twice during a 5 day stay as the location and decor was great. Food was also enjoyable, however the service was very poor. Decided to sit in the outer part of the restaurant and whilst the staff were pleasant the lack of understanding English spoiled the 2nd visit. When we ordered we asked for food to be served for both persons TOGETHER.\nOne meal was served, and the 2nd at least 10 minutes later which was disappointing. Since Covid 19 I am well aware that staff changes have made it necessary to employ new staff and staff do not have the experience in dealing with foreign visitors. Overall though, I enjoyed the food, and would try again next visit to Nha Trang.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 27, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
